{"id":"n67049-1-9","stage":4,"title":"어원 · 语源","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n67049-1-9-1","ko":"이 말의 어원이 뭔지 궁금해.","zh":"我很好奇这个词的词源是什么。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"말의","meaning":"词语，词汇","explanation":"말：词语，词汇；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"4","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어원이","meaning":"语源，词源","explanation":"어원：语源，词源；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"어원","audio":"/audio/6491c52fb98100962215.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67049","senseId":"1","lemma":"어원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뭔지","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"궁금해.","meaning":"好奇，纳闷儿","explanation":"궁금하다：好奇，纳闷儿；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"궁금하다","audio":"/audio/8aa230c6a19b7e60293f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"35136","senseId":"1","lemma":"궁금하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"dfbb3ea79fc80c6f","term":"말","zh":"词语，词汇","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3","entryId":"27260","definition":"指单词、句子或文章。","pronunciation":["말ː"]},{"id":"6491c52fb9810096","term":"어원","zh":"语源，词源","audio":"/audio/6491c52fb98100962215.mp3","entryId":"67049","definition":"词语的根源的形态；或指产生某语言的根源。","pronunciation":["어ː원"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"8aa230c6a19b7e60","term":"궁금하다","zh":"好奇，纳闷儿","audio":"/audio/8aa230c6a19b7e60293f.mp3","entryId":"35136","definition":"非常想知道。","pronunciation":["궁금하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/fa88c37308197eae6615.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n67049-1-9-2","ko":"도서관에 가면 어원 사전이 있을 거야. 한번 찾아보자.","zh":"去图书馆的话应该会有词源词典，我们去找找看吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"도서관에","meaning":"图书馆","explanation":"도서관：图书馆；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"도서관","audio":"/audio/9ee22c8536d3503a4b1c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40295","senseId":"1","lemma":"도서관","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가면","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어원","meaning":"语源，词源","explanation":"어원：语源，词源","readings":[{"term":"어원","audio":"/audio/6491c52fb98100962215.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67049","senseId":"1","lemma":"어원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사전이","meaning":"辞典，词典","explanation":"사전：辞典，词典；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사전","audio":"/audio/7b67a8962fe34d193c29.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61329","senseId":"1","lemma":"사전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있을","meaning":"可能","explanation":"있다：可能；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"6","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거야.","meaning":"表示某人的所有物。","explanation":"거：表示某人的所有物。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"3","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한번","meaning":"有时间","explanation":"한번：有时间","readings":[{"term":"한번","audio":"/audio/54e30ff4210956a6d721.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57336","senseId":"3","lemma":"한번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"찾아보자.","meaning":"查找，翻找","explanation":"찾아보다：查找，翻找；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"찾아보다","audio":"/audio/a3eafbcd1004a6ce98a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29758","senseId":"2","lemma":"찾아보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9ee22c8536d3503a","term":"도서관","zh":"图书馆","audio":"/audio/9ee22c8536d3503a4b1c.mp3","entryId":"40295","definition":"收藏大量书籍和资料等，以供人们借阅或学习而建造的设施。","pronunciation":["도서관"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"从一个地方移动到另一个地方。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"6491c52fb9810096","term":"어원","zh":"语源，词源","audio":"/audio/6491c52fb98100962215.mp3","entryId":"67049","definition":"词语的根源的形态；或指产生某语言的根源。","pronunciation":["어ː원"]},{"id":"7b67a8962fe34d19","term":"사전","zh":"辞典，词典","audio":"/audio/7b67a8962fe34d193c29.mp3","entryId":"61329","definition":"按一定次序将词语汇集整理以说明其发音、 含义、 词源、 用法等的书籍。","pronunciation":["사전"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"可能","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"存在发生某种状况的可能性或实为如此。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示某人的所有物。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示某人的所有物。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"54e30ff4210956a6","term":"한번","zh":"有时间","audio":"/audio/54e30ff4210956a6d721.mp3","entryId":"57336","definition":"有机会的某个时候。","pronunciation":["한번"]},{"id":"a3eafbcd1004a6ce","term":"찾아보다","zh":"查找，翻找","audio":"/audio/a3eafbcd1004a6ce98a6.mp3","entryId":"29758","definition":"为了得到想要的信息而仔细观察。","pronunciation":["차자보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/edfb023e0ac66a79ad01.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.777,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=67049","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","lice